; Delegated zone apex only. Every usable name under it is synthesised by the
; template blocks in the Corefile; this file exists so unmatched names get an
; NXDOMAIN carrying a SOA, and so apex SOA/NS queries are answered truthfully.
;
; The nameserver is named in the parent zone (ns1.myownsuite.org), not inside
; this one, so there is no circular dependency and no glue record to maintain.

$ORIGIN local.myownsuite.org.
$TTL 3600

@   IN  SOA ns1.myownsuite.org. hostmaster.myownsuite.org. (
        2026081501  ; serial
        7200        ; refresh
        3600        ; retry
        1209600     ; expire
        60 )        ; negative TTL, kept short so a DHCP change recovers quickly

@   IN  NS  ns1.myownsuite.org.
